silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_05_bridge_to_11_base_commutative_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'P07CrossPaperBridgesBridgeTo11BaseCommutativeYonedaHomLeg1', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, VetRecord_77 is the clinical-record information artifact about Mittens; it depicts Mittens via a typed aboutness arrow and is not itself the cat." .
